  "stageId": "act5d0_06",
  "title": "10:26P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f604287dfa0a0a1b52e6f34fec6c523d693125da7dff3afb051c1ddfd17da494",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "10:26 P.M.    天氣/多雲\n日落大道，“大地的盡頭”酒吧"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "那老闆，這瓶酒又是哪一年的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "嗯哼，沉澱的色澤，悠久的香氣，後覺的甜味，綿長的口感，這是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "上個月在超市買來的便宜酒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "十猜十中耶，不愧是自稱龍門第一的品酒師！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "呸，說了多少遍了，這是儲備武器，不是用來喝的！空！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "好好好，這是漱口水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "欸......用炎國黃酒漱口嗎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "酒精的確可以消毒，吧台下面有工業酒精，能湊合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "算了，有這個錢，不如買點別的好啦，花錢的精髓就在於過程，過程！和金額無關！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "各位，蘋果派烤好了！派對開始啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "哦~是能天使姐親手烤的派！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "乾杯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "......雖然不知不覺就變成這樣了，但這是什麼派對來著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嗯？拜松的歡迎會呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "......那拜松本人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嗯！不知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "那就換個藉口，我們永遠不缺藉口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......你們在做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "呃。在等你開派對，吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "啊，歡迎來到大地的盡頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "遲到罰酒三杯，主角遲到翻三倍，但你不能喝酒，所以汽水九杯，請。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "為什麼要叫這個名字......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（還有這個裝修風格，好閃亮.....為什麼還有企鵝......這是某種龐克藝術嗎......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "別傻站著了，快進來，這可是你的歡迎派對，要不要蘋果派？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "原來在我和莫斯提馬小姐對付那些黑手黨的時候，你們卻在這裡開派對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "那麼......那個頭目呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "讓他跑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "準確來說，是我准許他跑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "反正就是跑了......那接下來怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "敵人的數量，目的，身份，都已經很明顯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "來自敘拉古的黑手黨，想要奪取企鵝物流在龍門的勢力範圍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "......雖然我們應該是個物流公司......算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "不要放在心上，德克薩斯，總會有那麼幾天要用來清掃門戶的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "說這話就更不像是一個正經公司了哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "他們這是白費力氣啦，老闆的那些生意，就算拱手相讓他們也玩不來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "企鵝物流是不可取代的，而我更是不可取代的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "既然如此，我們有很多種解決方法，為什麼一定要和他們火拼起來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "不知道......你們，一直以來是怎麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "好啦好啦，不要這麼認真嘛，找個機會把他們的頭兒揍一頓扔進江裡，不就完事了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "這場鬧劇就和沒能睡著的回籠覺一樣浪費時間，我完——全提不起興趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "就是嘛，這可不是什麼值得認真討論的事情。來，口香糖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "但至少我們應該制定一個計畫......等等，這口香糖是什麼味道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "白馬醇味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "把這個牌子的口香糖列入危險品範疇吧，可頌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "看到新口味就進貨了，沒注意，誒嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "喂，你們派對還搞不搞了，有酒有菜，音樂呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "收到~！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "居然真的是爵士樂......出乎意料......雖然有點.....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "以前這裡的主人的確是個爵士樂愛好者啦，只是在轉讓給老闆之後發生了一些小小的風格變化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "小小的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "主要是因為老闆自己的唱片剛才全部被——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "停，不要讓我回憶起悲傷的往事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "說到底，誰讓他查出那種麻煩的病，我肯抽空來幫他照顧這家酒吧就不錯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "難道是礦石病？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "龍門經歷了那麼多事情，對感染者的態度應該轉變了不少才對......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "是酒精過敏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "對一個立志成為龍門最好的調酒師的傢伙而言，的確是絕症了呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "怎麼又有髒東西闖進來了，喂，你們幾個，想活命的立刻趴到吧台後面去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "得令！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "啊，吧台下面有一枚硬幣，賺到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "不要亂動啦，這裡很窄——唔！能天使！你的光環！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "別發呆，拜松，趴下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "欸？啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "開火！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "唔啊，這下店裡可全毀了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "大帝先生好像還在外面，沒關係嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "這些人怎麼就這麼死纏爛打，在店鋪被轟乾淨之前還擊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "抱歉，老闆，我的橡皮彈好像用完了，不如咱們抄凳子上？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "不是專門買了一批便宜酒放在這兒當武器的嗎！?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "欸、剛才喝的是最後一瓶了，剩下的都是值錢貨哎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "不管了，只有迂腐的老東西才會把美酒儲存在自己的宮殿裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "我們應該讓這些美妙的釀造物綻放，無論是價值層面，還是實體層面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "呃？但是那些藏酒的價格可非常——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "拿著，人手一瓶，記住，只砸頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "保護了我的酒吧，就是保護了這片大地，上吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "能天使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "知道啦！抄瓶子砸人是吧，我擅長的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "等、等等我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "他們衝出來了！小心！呃啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "十萬、十五萬、四十五萬，七十萬......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "那瓶多少來著？不！等等能天使！那瓶是——哎呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "這、這是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "今晚的損失數字，不行，至少我們兩個還可以靠盾牌戰鬥，不能再讓損失擴大了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "明、明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "OK~三，二，一，上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
